  "description": "The fastest deep cloning library, supporting anything from .NET 4.6 to modern .NET 10+ with no dependencies. FastCloner uses a unique source generator capable of analyzing object graphs and cloning object without explicit annotations. For types that cannot be cloned, such as HttpClient, FastCloner uses a highly optimized reflection-based fallback. Zero dependencies, blazingly fast, built for developers who need cloning that just works.",
